    "Name": "Undine",
    "Details": "The Undine battle armor was created by Clan Goliath Scorpion as a combat upgrade to the original \"water elementals,\" the underwater exoskeletons that inspired Clan Wolf's Elemental battle armor. This Undine version replaces the UMU with standard Elementals JJs, while retaining its signature LRM/T launcher. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.93</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can mount Omni units, can melee, can swarm.</b></color>",
